    "הוּא עָנָה בְּ%@ עַל %lld שְׁאֵלוֹת, בְּ%lld%% הַצְלָחָה.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "He answered %2$lld questions in %1$@, with %3$lld%% correct."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "По %1$@ он ответил на %#@count@, %3$lld%% верных."
          },
          "substitutions": {
