    "🍕 חִלַּקְנוּ פִּיצָה לְ־%lld חֲלָקִים שָׁוִים וְאָכַלְנוּ %lld. אֵיזֶה שֶׁבֶר אָכַלְנוּ?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "🍕 We cut a pizza into %lld equal slices and ate %lld. What fraction did we eat?"
